Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: asciicam
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: webcam to ASCII art in the terminal, no libc, no dependencies
 AsciiCam renders a webcam (or a built-in demo picture) as coloured text.
 It is a single static binary that talks to the kernel with raw system calls,
 loads effect plugins with its own ELF loader and needs no shared libraries.
